    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n31169" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱργμός</span></b> , later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰργμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴργω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cage, prison</i>, <i><span class="en">
